<div class="muqavi-majoon-desc">
  <p>
    Majoon-e-Muqavi is a complete traditional Unani herbal formula, prepared from a hakeem family’s recipe and traditionally used to support male vitality, stamina and marital wellness. It brings together more than 60 natural ingredients, including Egyptian salep, white musli, ashwagandha, saffron, ginseng, dry fruits and pure honey. It is traditionally used to support healthy desire (libido), male strength and endurance, and healthy blood flow.
  </p>
  <p>
    In addition, this formula is prepared in the classical majoon form, a nourishing blend meant to be taken regularly as a daily tonic. Instead of relying on a single ingredient or a quick fix, Majoon-e-Muqavi combines many traditionally valued herbs to support overall strength and balance over time, when taken consistently as directed and alongside healthy habits.
  </p>
  <p>For more details, please read the benefits and ingredients sections.</p>
</div>